# ZollTool server configuration.
# Copy to server/.env and fill in. server/.env is gitignored — never committed.
# Used by `npm run dev:server` (loaded by src/env.ts) and by Docker (--env-file).
# Real shell/Docker env always overrides what's here.

# ── Core (required) ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
JWT_SECRET=change-me-to-a-long-random-string-min-16
# Let anyone register without an invite code (handy for local testing).
REGISTRATION_OPEN=1
# Optional: seed an owner account on first boot.
# OWNER_EMAIL=you@example.com
# OWNER_PASSWORD=pick-a-strong-password
